        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dmitri Usatov, Antonín Dvořák, Adolf Wenig\n- Works: The Devil and Kate, Dimitrij\n- Roles: libretto, composer\n- Topics: opera production contributions, friends of the composer\n\nFacts:\n- Dmitri Usatov sang in operas including Dimitrij and The Devil and Kate.\n- Antonín Dvořák composed The Devil and Kate.\n- Adolf Wenig wrote the libretto for The Devil and Kate.\n- The claim states that The Devil and Kate had more contributions to its making from friends of its composer than the other opera mentioned.",
